<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>导出报表</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: #f0f2f5; }
        .admin-header { background: #1a1a2e; color: white; padding: 16px 24px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .admin-header a { color: #aaa; text-decoration: none; }
        .admin-header a:hover { color: white; }
        .sidebar { background: white; width: 200px; min-height: calc(100vh - 70px); padding: 20px 0; border-right: 1px solid #e8ecf1; position: fixed; left: 0; top: 70px; bottom: 0; overflow-y: auto; }
        .sidebar a { display: block; padding: 10px 24px; color: #333; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; }
        .sidebar a:hover { background: #f0f2f5; }
        .sidebar a.active { background: #667eea; color: white; }
        .sidebar .section-title { padding: 8px 24px; font-size: 11px; color: #999; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; }
        .main { margin-left: 200px; padding: 24px; }
        .card { background: white; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .export-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; max-width: 600px; }
        .export-item { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center; border: 2px solid #e8ecf1; }
        .export-item .icon { font-size: 40px; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .export-item .name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; }
        .export-item .desc { font-size: 13px; color: #888; margin: 4px 0 12px; }
        .btn-export { 
            display: inline-block; 
            padding: 12px 24px; 
            border: none; 
            border-radius: 8px; 
            cursor: pointer; 
            font-size: 14px; 
            font-weight: 600; 
            color: white; 
            text-decoration: none; 
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            border: none;
        }
        .btn-export.blue { background: #667eea; }
        .btn-export.green { background: #27ae60; }
        .btn-export.orange { background: #f39c12; }
        .btn-export.red { background: #e74c3c; }
        .btn-export:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
        .btn-export:visited { color: white; }
        .btn-export:active { color: white; }
        .btn-export:focus { color: white; outline: none; }
        .link-list a { display: block; color: #667eea; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e8ecf1; }
        .link-list a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        .test-link { 
            display: block; 
            background: #e8f0fe; 
            padding: 12px 16px; 
            border-radius: 8px; 
            margin: 6px 0; 
            color: #1a73e8; 
            text-decoration: none; 
            font-size: 14px; 
            border: 1px solid #d2e3fc; 
        }
        .test-link:hover { background: #d2e3fc; }
        .text-center { text-align: center; }
        .mt-12 { margin-top: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="admin-header">
        <h2>🔐 管理后台</h2>
        <div class="user-info">
            <span>👋 <%= user.username %></span>
            <a href="/admin/logout">退出</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <nav class="sidebar">
        <div class="section-title">📊 核心功能</div>
        <a href="/admin/dashboard">📊 控制台</a>
        <a href="/admin/users">👤 用户管理</a>
        <a href="/admin/deposits">💰 充值管理</a>
        <a href="/admin/withdrawals">🏦 取款管理</a>
        <a href="/admin/trades">📈 交易管理</a>
        <div class="section-title">📢 内容管理</div>
        <a href="/admin/announcements">📢 公告管理</a>
        <a href="/admin/notifications">📨 通知管理</a>
        <div class="section-title">📊 数据统计</div>
        <a href="/admin/finance">💰 财务统计</a>
        <a href="/admin/invite">🎯 邀请系统</a>
        <a href="/admin/export" class="active">📊 导出报表</a>
        <div class="section-title">🛡️ 安全与风控</div>
        <a href="/admin/risk-control">🛡️ 风控管理</a>
        <a href="/admin/login-logs">📋 登录日志</a>
        <a href="/admin/backup">💾 数据备份</a>
        <div class="section-title">🎫 客服支持</div>
        <a href="/admin/tickets">🎫 工单管理</a>
        <div class="section-title">🔑 系统管理</div>
        <a href="/admin/api">🔑 API管理</a>
        <a href="/admin/settings">⚙️ 系统设置</a>
        <a href="/admin/logs">📋 操作日志</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="main">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom:16px;">📊 导出报表</h2>

        <div class="card">
            <h3 style="margin-bottom:16px;">📋 点击按钮导出（使用 JS 跳转）</h3>
            <p style="color:#888;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:16px;">点击按钮后会在当前页面跳转并下载。</p>

            <div class="export-grid">
                <div class="export-item">
                    <span class="icon">👤</span>
                    <div class="name">用户数据</div>
                    <div class="desc">导出所有用户信息</div>
                    <button class="btn-export blue" onclick="window.location.href='/admin/export?type=users'">📥 导出</button>
                </div>

                <div class="export-item">
                    <span class="icon">📈</span>
                    <div class="name">交易数据</div>
                    <div class="desc">导出所有交易记录</div>
                    <button class="btn-export green" onclick="window.location.href='/admin/export?type=trades'">📥 导出</button>
                </div>

                <div class="export-item">
                    <span class="icon">💰</span>
                    <div class="name">充值数据</div>
                    <div class="desc">导出所有充值记录</div>
                    <button class="btn-export orange" onclick="window.location.href='/admin/export?type=deposits'">📥 导出</button>
                </div>

                <div class="export-item">
                    <span class="icon">🏦</span>
                    <div class="name">取款数据</div>
                    <div class="desc">导出所有取款记录</div>
                    <button class="btn-export red" onclick="window.location.href='/admin/export?type=withdrawals'">📥 导出</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3 style="margin-bottom:12px;">📌 或者直接点击下面的测试链接</h3>
            <a class="test-link" href="/admin/export?type=users" onclick="window.location.href='/admin/export?type=users'; return false;">📄 测试链接 1: 导出用户数据</a>
            <a class="test-link" href="/admin/export?type=trades" onclick="window.location.href='/admin/export?type=trades'; return false;">📄 测试链接 2: 导出交易数据</a>
            <a class="test-link" href="/admin/export?type=deposits" onclick="window.location.href='/admin/export?type=deposits'; return false;">📄 测试链接 3: 导出充值数据</a>
            <a class="test-link" href="/admin/export?type=withdrawals" onclick="window.location.href='/admin/export?type=withdrawals'; return false;">📄 测试链接 4: 导出取款数据</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="background:#e8f8f0;border:2px solid #27ae60;">
            <h3 style="color:#27ae60;margin-bottom:12px;">✅ 如果以上都不行，直接在地址栏输入</h3>
            <p style="color:#555;font-size:14px;background:white;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;word-break:break-all;">
                <strong>用户数据：</strong> http://localhost:3000/admin/export?type=users<br>
                <strong>交易数据：</strong> http://localhost:3000/admin/export?type=trades<br>
                <strong>充值数据：</strong> http://localhost:3000/admin/export?type=deposits<br>
                <strong>取款数据：</strong> http://localhost:3000/admin/export?type=withdrawals
            </p>
            <p style="color:#888;font-size:13px;margin-top:8px;">💡 复制这些链接到地址栏，按回车即可下载！</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>